1
00:00:00,734 --> 00:00:02,204
(Amy:)Honestly, I just
want you to be quiet

2
00:00:02,202 --> 00:00:03,532
(Amy:)but I'm all out of taffy.

3
00:00:06,974 --> 00:00:08,704
(Howard:)You busy?

4
00:00:08,709 --> 00:00:10,879
(Howard:)There's somebody out here
who wants to meet you.

5
00:00:10,878 --> 00:00:12,108
(Bernadette:)Who is it?

6
00:00:12,112 --> 00:00:14,612
(Howard:)Say hello to everybody's
little friend--

7
00:00:14,615 --> 00:00:16,945
(Howard:)remote control
Stephen Hawking!

8
00:00:21,722 --> 00:00:23,492
(Bernadette:)Where did you get that?

9
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:25,320
(Howard:)I found him in an old box.

10
00:00:25,326 --> 00:00:27,756
(Bernadette:)Why would you buy it?

11
00:00:27,761 --> 00:00:29,591
(Howard:)I didn't buy it.

12
00:00:29,596 --> 00:00:31,466
(Howard:)I made it.

13
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:33,433
(Bernadette:)Last question.

14
00:00:33,434 --> 00:00:35,704
(Bernadette:)What is wrong with you?

15
00:00:36,603 --> 00:00:38,573
(Howard:)What's the big deal?

16
00:00:38,572 --> 00:00:40,372
(Bernadette:)Howie, it's in poor taste.

17
00:00:40,374 --> 00:00:41,774
(Howard:)No, it's not.
Check it out.

18
00:00:41,775 --> 00:00:43,045
(Howard:)He says fun stuff.

19
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:45,013
(Remote-control Hawking:)Hey good lookin',

20
00:00:45,012 --> 00:00:47,012
(Remote-control Hawking:)want to go for a spin?

21
00:00:52,653 --> 00:01:01,023
(Howard:)His eyes also light up
in the dark.

